    "body": "## Summary\r\n\r\n- Adds `scripts/bench-secp-vs-bls.ts` — a dev benchmark comparing secp256k1 (v0/v1/v2) and\r\n  BLS12-381 (v3) for the two hot wallet-side primitives:\r\n  - **Blinding**: `blindMessage` vs `blindMessageBls`.\r\n  - **Proof verification**: secp NUT-12 DLEQ re-blind vs BLS per-proof pairing vs BLS batch pairing.\r\n- Streams progress while running and prints a short, data-driven summary computed from the run.\r\n- Fixes a stale import in `scripts/bench-bls-verify.ts` (`crypto/bls` → `crypto/curve_bls`).\r\n\r\nDev-only; no `src/` or runtime changes. Run with `npx tsx scripts/bench-secp-vs-bls.ts`.\r\n\r\n",
